OL,3,GNEWSAHuge security operation under way
OL,4,Afor Trump's visit to Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Garda Siochana (Irish police force)
OL,7,Fhave described preparations for the US
OL,8,Fpresident's visit to the Republic of
OL,9,FIreland as "one of the biggest security
OL,10,Fand policing operations" ever
OL,11,Fundertaken by them.
OL,13,FThe force has declared an extraordinary
OL,14,Fevent and it will see gardai perform
OL,15,F10,000 12-hour shifts between Friday
OL,16,Fand Sunday.
OL,18,FUS President Donald Trump is expected
OL,19,Fto touch down on Air Force One at
OL,20,FDublin Airport on Saturday morning for
OL,21,Fa two-day visit.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
